          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase bg-trimble-pale text-trimble-dark border border-trimble-border">
              Trimble Google Sheets Model
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Active formulas calibrated with $5,869 ACV</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-trimble-navy mt-1">Google Sheets Architecture with Live Formulas</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Click any cell to inspect its exact formula or copy all rows directly into <code class="font-mono text-trimble-dark bg-trimble-pale px-1 py-0.5 rounded">sheets.new</code>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 shrink-0">
